OL,3,GNEWSAAircraft standby plan aims to
OL,4,Aimprove reliability
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn airline is planning to keep one of
OL,7,Fits planes on standby next year to help
OL,8,Fwhen flights are disrupted.
OL,10,FAurigny said its summer schedule for
OL,11,F2027 aimed to "keep Guernsey well
OL,12,Fconnected" with flights to destinations
OL,13,Fincluding London Gatwick, Jersey,
OL,14,FDublin, Edinburgh and Paris.
OL,16,FWithin its schedule, the States-owned
OL,17,Fairline said it was building in more
OL,18,Fspare capacity with one of its five
OL,19,Faircraft being held in reserve to cover
OL,20,Fany service issues.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
