OL,3,GNEWSAAircraft standby plan aims to
OL,4,Aimprove reliability
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhilip Saunders, chief commercial
OL,7,Fofficer of Aurigny, said the airline
OL,8,Fwanted to "work smarter" with its
OL,9,Faircraft to give passengers a more
OL,10,Freliable service.
